@@ -9,12 +9,16 @@ ## [Unreleased]
 
 ### Added
 
+- Session authentication (no starter kit): Livewire 4 full-page `login` and `register`, logout, forgot/reset password, e-mail verification (`User` implements `MustVerifyEmail`) and a verified-only `/home`. Login and registration are rate limited, forgot-password never reveals whether an e-mail exists, and verification links only verify the logged-in user. See [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md#authentication).
+- Brazilian Portuguese by default (`APP_LOCALE=pt_BR`, English fallback) with `lang/{en,pt_BR}/ui.php` and a shared Bulma layout/components under `resources/views`.
+- One app-wide password rule via `Password::defaults()` (min 8, letters, mixed case, numbers).
 - Database schema and Mermaid diagram in [`docs/database-schema.md`](docs/database-schema.md).
 - Business rules documentation in [`docs/business-rules.md`](docs/business-rules.md): MVP queue management, entity/subscription, roles (admin, owner, employee), tickets, priorities, fairness (3-ticket rule), deterministic call panel, and channels (Flutter totem, web TV, attendant).
 - This changelog (Keep a Changelog).
 
 ### Changed
 
+- `.env.example` ships `APP_NAME=PegaFila` and `APP_LOCALE=pt_BR`; `phpunit.xml` pins `APP_LOCALE`/`APP_FALLBACK_LOCALE`.
 - Documented architecture: PegaFilaWeb is a single repository for frontend, backend and totem API; Flutter remains only as a separate client.
 - Simplified model: ticket is single-use (one call; write-once except `called_at`/`called_by`) — removed `ticket_calls` table; ticket knows only its queue (no `totem_id`). `tickets.priority` is now an integer (higher = more prioritized).
 - Expanded financial model: `billing_accounts` (1:0..1 with entity) + `subscriptions` + `plans` isolate financial data. New tables: `payment_options` (cycle, method, discount, refund window) and `payments` (individual charges). `billing_accounts` has `cpf_cnpj`. Subscription 1:1 with `billing_account_id` (UK); history in `payments`. Added `tickets.code`, explicit unique constraints, and circular FK note for owner. Removed per-queue user access limit.
